## SQ-MG-21 | Cod 'n' Chips merged into Fish and Chips
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -n "itemMerges\|cod_n_chips" logs/kubejs/server.log \| head`; `/kubejs dump recipes` or the recipe probe for outputs `veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips` and `pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips`; `/give @p pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips` then check the inventory
@pass no recipe makes or uses Cod 'n' Chips; Fish and Chips has only `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/fish_and_chips` plus its Slice & Dice mirror and the salting recipe (3 in all; container bowl; the Fries grid route left with the Fries 2026-11-01); no `veggiesdelight:cooking/fish_and_chips` or its More Delight compat; the given stack becomes Fish and Chips (MG-48, VD-47)
@fails pair not loaded (startup `pneumaticcraft/item_merges.js` requires both mods); `already merged` warning
@jars creativecommon creativedelight
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> cdevtest makes pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips
> cdevtest uses pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips
> cdevtest makes veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips
> pbot spawn mg21 110 -60 506 minecraft:overworld survival
> give mg21 pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips 2
sleep 3
> clear mg21 veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips 0
> clear mg21 pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips 0
expect verb=makes item=pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips n=0
expect verb=uses item=pneumaticcraft:cod_n_chips alone=0 shared=0
# r1120lr batch fault: n=3 = creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/fish_and_chips + its Slice & Dice mirror + the salting recipe (recipes/all.csv 2026-11-19); verb=makes prints id= result=, not '->'
expect verb=makes item=veggiesdelight:fish_and_chips n=3\b
expect verb=makes id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/fish_and_chips result=
reject veggiesdelight:cooking/fish_and_chips
reject veggiesdelight:compat/moredelight\S*fish_and_chips
expect Found 2 matching item
expect No items were found on player mg21
kjsreject (?i)already merged.*cod_n_chips
> pbot remove mg21
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

